  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A safety net programme designed to stabilise the incomes and assets of seven and a hal million of the most vulnerable people and increase community assets in 292 out of Ethiopias 630 woredas. Main objective is to provide transfers to food insecure households in chronically food insecure woredas in a way that prevents asset deplition at the household level and creats assets at the community level.</narrative>
